@startuml
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowThickness 1
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 65

title Diabetify 2.0 Counterfactual Planner Service - Component Diagram

package "Counterfactual Planner Service" {
  package "Interface Layer" {
    [Counterfactual Job Consumer] as JobConsumer
    [Counterfactual Result Publisher] as ResultPublisher
    [Health Check Endpoint] as HealthCheck
  }

  package "Planning Orchestration Layer" {
    [Planning Request Validator] as RequestValidator
    [User Context Builder] as ContextBuilder
    [Constraint Parser] as ConstraintParser
    [Counterfactual Planning Orchestrator] as PlannerOrch
  }

  package "Counterfactual Generation Layer" {
    [Mutable Feature Selector] as FeatureSelector
    [Action Space Builder] as ActionSpace
    [Candidate Generator] as CandidateGenerator
    [Optimization Engine] as Optimizer
    [Feasibility Validator] as FeasibilityValidator
    [Scenario Ranker] as ScenarioRanker
    [Recommendation Formatter] as Formatter
  }

  package "Policy & Knowledge Layer" {
    [Feature Mutability Rules] as MutabilityRules
    [Lifestyle Constraint Rules] as ConstraintRules
    [Medical Safety Rules] as MedicalRules
  }

  package "Integration Layer" {
    [RabbitMQ Adapter] as RabbitMQAdapter
    [ML Prediction Client] as MLClient
    [Model Registry Client] as RegistryClient
    [Audit / Trace Logger] as AuditLogger
  }
}

queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ
rectangle "ML Prediction Service" as MLService
database "Model Registry" as ModelRegistry

RabbitMQAdapter --> MQ : consume planning jobs\npublish results
JobConsumer --> RabbitMQAdapter
ResultPublisher --> RabbitMQAdapter

JobConsumer --> RequestValidator
RequestValidator --> ContextBuilder
RequestValidator --> ConstraintParser

ContextBuilder --> PlannerOrch
ConstraintParser --> PlannerOrch

PlannerOrch --> FeatureSelector
PlannerOrch --> ActionSpace
PlannerOrch --> CandidateGenerator
PlannerOrch --> Optimizer
PlannerOrch --> FeasibilityValidator
PlannerOrch --> ScenarioRanker
PlannerOrch --> Formatter
PlannerOrch --> ResultPublisher
PlannerOrch --> AuditLogger : record planning traces

FeatureSelector --> MutabilityRules
ActionSpace --> ConstraintRules
CandidateGenerator --> ActionSpace
Optimizer --> CandidateGenerator
Optimizer --> MLClient : evaluate risk score
FeasibilityValidator --> ConstraintRules
FeasibilityValidator --> MedicalRules
ScenarioRanker --> FeasibilityValidator
Formatter --> ScenarioRanker

RegistryClient --> ModelRegistry : read active model metadata
PlannerOrch --> RegistryClient

MLClient --> MLService : score candidate scenarios

HealthCheck --> RabbitMQAdapter
HealthCheck --> MLClient
HealthCheck --> RegistryClient

note right of Optimizer
Searches for candidate actions
that reduce risk while minimizing
unrealistic or excessive changes.
end note

note right of FeasibilityValidator
Rejects candidates that violate
user constraints, feature mutability,
or medical safety rules.
end note

note right of ScenarioRanker
Ranks feasible scenarios by:
- risk reduction
- actionability
- proximity
- sparsity
- plausibility
end note

legend bottom
== Design Intent ==
This service generates actionable counterfactual recommendations.
It does not replace the prediction model; it uses the ML Prediction
Service to evaluate candidate scenarios and returns feasible plans.
endlegend

JobConsumer -[hidden]right-> ResultPublisher
ResultPublisher -[hidden]right-> HealthCheck
RequestValidator -[hidden]right-> ContextBuilder
ContextBuilder -[hidden]right-> ConstraintParser
FeatureSelector -[hidden]right-> ActionSpace
ActionSpace -[hidden]right-> CandidateGenerator
CandidateGenerator -[hidden]right-> Optimizer
Optimizer -[hidden]right-> FeasibilityValidator
FeasibilityValidator -[hidden]right-> ScenarioRanker
ScenarioRanker -[hidden]right-> Formatter
MutabilityRules -[hidden]right-> ConstraintRules
ConstraintRules -[hidden]right-> MedicalRules
RabbitMQAdapter -[hidden]right-> MLClient
MLClient -[hidden]right-> RegistryClient
RegistryClient -[hidden]right-> AuditLogger

@enduml
